<title>USA: C.R. Bard Inc Q1 EPS $0.46 vs $0.48.</title>
<headline>C.R. Bard Inc Q1 EPS $0.46 vs $0.48.</headline>
<dateline>MURRAY HILL, N.J. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.46		    $0.48</p>
<p> Net			 26,100		   27,100</p>
<p> Revs		     300,700		  289,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  57,029		   56,903</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: For quarter ended March 31</p>
<p>The 1997 Q1 includes the gain from a product line sale and foreign exchange losses which, in total, resulted in a $0.03 per share aftertax gain</p>
<p>The 1996 Q1 included nonrecurring items related to an asset writedown, the receipt of revenues related to prior year royalties, miscellaneous charges and tax reserve reversals reducing pretax income by $27.1 million with a positive aftertax impact of $0.01 a share.</p>
</text>
